    "bodyClass": "page-about",
    "body": "<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n  <section class=\"hero page-hero\"><img class=\"hero-media\" src=\"/assets/images/memory-press-original-v1.webp\" alt=\"Industrial press forming raw solution fragments into a finished product module\"><div class=\"hero-content\"><h1>A foundry for what comes next.</h1></div></section>\n  <section class=\"hero-brief\"><div class=\"section-shell hero-brief-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">The foundry</p><p class=\"hero-brief-copy\">Created by Hosho Digital to give proven delivery work the environment it needs to become a durable B2B product.</p></div><p class=\"hero-index\">A HOSHO DIGITAL COMPANY<br>Built for product independence</p></div></section>\n  <section class=\"section\"><div class=\"section-shell origin-layout\">\n    <div class=\"origin-word\" aria-hidden=\"true\">鋳造所</div>\n    <div class=\"origin-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The idea</p><p class=\"lead\" data-reveal>A traditional foundry takes raw material and gives it a useful, repeatable form. Chuzosho does the same for solution work.</p><p data-reveal>Strong delivery creates more than a project outcome. It creates methods, tools, and product patterns that can solve the same class of problem again. Chuzosho gives those patterns a dedicated environment to mature.</p><p data-reveal>Semiconductor foundries offer a useful analogy: specialised capability helps many products become real without every company rebuilding the same production system. Chuzosho applies that mindset to digital solutions.</p></div>\n  </div></section>\n  <section class=\"section section-dark\"><div class=\"section-shell\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Foundry principles</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">Built to earn independence.</h2></div><p class=\"section-intro\">Each product must stay connected to a real business need while becoming more reusable, governable, and self-sustaining.</p></div><dl class=\"principle-ledger\">\n    <div class=\"principle-row\" data-reveal><dt>Proven need</dt><dd>Begin with a real requirement and accountable owner, not a technology looking for a problem.</dd></div>\n    <div class=\"principle-row\" data-reveal><dt>Shared core</dt><dd>Keep the value that repeats. Remove assumptions that belong to one engagement.</dd></div>\n    <div class=\"principle-row\" data-reveal><dt>Measurable evidence</dt><dd>Make claims testable and preserve the observations that support them.</dd></div>\n    <div class=\"principle-row\" data-reveal><dt>Standalone potential</dt><dd>Design for a product that can eventually support its own market, team, and company.</dd></div>\n  </dl></div></section>\n  <section class=\"graduation-band\"><div class=\"graduation-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The long view</p><h2>From solution to product. From product to company.</h2><p>Graduation is earned. A product advances when its need, evidence, operating model, and market path are strong enough.</p></div><img src=\"/assets/images/growing-archive-original-v1.webp\" alt=\"Expanding modular archive preserving product evidence\" loading=\"lazy\"></section>\n  <section class=\"cta-band\"><img src=\"/assets/images/promotion-gates-original-v1.webp\" alt=\"Prototype advancing through controlled product promotion gates\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"cta-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Explore the portfolio</p><h2>See what is being forged.</h2><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"/solutions/\">View Solutions</a></div></section>\n"
