  "/approach/": {
    "title": "Approach | Chuzosho",
    "bodyClass": "page-approach",
    "body": "<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n  <section class=\"hero page-hero\"><img class=\"hero-media\" src=\"/assets/images/checked-actions-original-v1.webp\" alt=\"Proposal plates advancing through a controlled industrial inspection line\"><div class=\"hero-content\"><h1>Turn proposals into checked actions.</h1></div></section>\n  <section class=\"hero-brief\"><div class=\"section-shell hero-brief-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">The foundry approach</p><p class=\"hero-brief-copy\">A disciplined route from market requirement to reusable product, with evidence at every important gate.</p></div><p class=\"hero-index\">NEED → CORE → EVIDENCE → INDEPENDENCE</p></div></section>\n  <section class=\"section\"><div class=\"section-shell\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">One product system</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">Shape. Forge. Prove. Graduate.</h2></div><p class=\"section-intro\">The sequence is simple on purpose. Each stage answers a different question before the product earns more investment.</p></div><div class=\"approach-flow\">\n    <article class=\"flow-stage\" data-reveal><p class=\"stage-name\">SHAPE</p><h3>Should this exist?</h3><p>Define the client requirement, user, constraint, and accountable business result.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"flow-stage\" data-reveal><p class=\"stage-name\">FORGE</p><h3>What should repeat?</h3><p>Build the reusable core and the tools that make it useful across engagements.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"flow-stage\" data-reveal><p class=\"stage-name\">PROVE</p><h3>Can we trust the loop?</h3><p>Test actions, observations, evidence, cost, and operating behaviour under controlled conditions.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"flow-stage\" data-reveal><p class=\"stage-name\">GRADUATE</p><h3>Can it stand alone?</h3><p>Prepare the product, channel, governance, and ownership needed for independent growth.</p></article>\n  </div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"machine-band\"><img src=\"/assets/images/harness-system-original-v1.webp\" alt=\"Governed model core connected to tools, checks, observations, and evidence systems\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"machine-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Product discipline</p><h2>The model is one part of the machine.</h2><p>Tools, checks, evidence, and observations turn raw capability into a dependable product experience. The surrounding system is where product discipline lives.</p></div></section>\n  <section class=\"section section-bright\"><div class=\"section-shell\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Evidence loop</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">Every turn should make the next turn better.</h2></div><p class=\"section-intro\">Actions become observations. Observations become evidence. Evidence improves selection, repair, and continued product learning.</p></div><div class=\"evidence-loop\">\n    <article class=\"loop-item\" data-reveal><p class=\"stage-name\">PROPOSE</p><h3>Generate options, not unchecked answers.</h3><p>Keep multiple possibilities visible long enough to compare them.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"loop-item\" data-reveal><p class=\"stage-name\">CHECK</p><h3>Make quality executable.</h3><p>Translate safety, business expectations, and operating standards into practical gates.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"loop-item\" data-reveal><p class=\"stage-name\">LEARN</p><h3>Grow an archive, not one winner.</h3><p>Preserve trajectories and evidence so progress survives a single run.</p></article>\n  </div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"cta-band\"><img src=\"/assets/images/correctness-gates-original-v1.webp\" alt=\"Three precision gates validating a product before release\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"cta-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Enter the foundry</p><h2>Have a solution worth repeating?</h2><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact Us</a></div></section>\n"
  },
